{"key": "KXFBUSTER|Filibuster weakened before 2026|If the U.S. Senate lowers the threshold for the filibuster by December 31, 2025, then the market resolves to Yes. If the U.S. Senate changes its rules or precedent to lower the threshold for cloture for any legislative action whose threshold for cloture at time of Issuance is three-fifths of all Senators duly chosen and sworn, then the market resolves to Yes. Changes to reconciliation rules are not included.", "decision": "NO", "confidence": 0.85, "reasoning": "The resolution criteria requires that \"the U.S. Senate changes its rules or precedent to lower the threshold for cloture for any legislative action.\" While the Senate did lower the cloture threshold for nominations from 60 to 51 votes on September 17, 2025, this change applies to nominations, not legislative action. The legislative filibuster\u2014the 60-vote threshold for general legislation\u2014remained unchanged through December 31, 2025, despite Trump's push to eliminate it. Senate Majority Leader Thune explicitly stated there were insufficient votes to change the legislative filibuster. Since the resolution criteria specifically focuses on \"legislative action\" and the only threshold reduction that occurred was for nominations, the market resolves NO.", "sources": ["https://news.bgov.com/bloomberg-government-news/senate-gop-goes-nuclear-on-rule-change-in-push-to-speed-nominees", "https://www.foxnews.com/politics/senate-republicans-push-major-rule-change-fast-track-trump-nominees-batches-week", "https://timesofoman.com/article/164542-dont-be-weak-and-stupid-trump-urges-republicans-to-end-senate-filibuster", "https://news.bgov.com/bloomberg-government-news/senates-flagship-rule-is-on-shaky-ground-after-nuclear-move"], "queries": ["Senate filibuster threshold lowered 2025", "Senate cloture rules changed December 2025", "\"filibuster\" \"Senate\" September 2025 nominations threshold", "legislative filibuster December 31 2025"], "links": ["https://news.bg